  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up Maternal and Child Healthcare in Amhara</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will include the operation for Caesarian sections and general surgery labs wards staff housing and maternity homes and basic and comprehensive emergency obstetric and neonatal care equipment, provision of water and electricity as required, means of transport for health care staff and possibly mobile outreach facilities. In-service and where necessary pre-service training of health staff on Basic and Comprehensive Emergency Obstetric and Neonatal care other essential Sexual and Reproductive Health (SRH) services health service quality improvement and Leadership / Health System Management.</narrative>
  </description>
